Port tooling policy (not applied by the sync)

Apply to a pstack-claude checkout at the pinned port commit, then run its
`bun tools/generate.mjs`, to restamp the Models and Reasoning effort sections that
01-model-routing-and-autonomy.patch carries. Needed only when refreshing the adaptation layer.

